{"source_term": "Aufhebung", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "sublation", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "德语Aufhebung同时包含否定(aufheben=取消)+保留(aufheben=保存)+提升(aufheben=举起)三重含义；英语sublation是学术新造词，仅在哲学语境中使用，日常语言无此词", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Aufhebung", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "扬弃", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'扬弃'保留了双重含义(扬=提升,弃=否定)，但丢失了'保留'这第三重含义；德语原词三义并存是不可翻译的核心", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "sublation", "source_lang": "en", "target_term": "扬弃", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "英语sublation是从德语Aufhebung的学术翻译，中文'扬弃'是独立翻译；两者都是对三重含义的不同程度简化", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Aufhebung", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "sursomption", "target_lang": "fr", "differential": "法语sursomption是Derrida等人提出的新造词，试图保留'超越式保留'之义；传统法译suppression仅保留否定义", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Geist", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "spirit", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "德语Geist兼具mind和spirit两义(主观精神/客观精神/绝对精神)；英语spirit偏宗教义，mind偏认知义，翻译必须二选一", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Geist", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "精神", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'精神'在日常语言中有'精力/心理状态'义，但在哲学语境中已固定为Geist的译名，语义窄化为黑格尔专用", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Geist", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "esprit", "target_lang": "fr", "differential": "法语esprit同样兼具mind(esprit analytique)和spirit(Saint-Esprit)两义，但法语哲学传统中esprit更偏笛卡尔式的理性思维", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Entfremdung", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "alienation", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "德语Entfremdung(使陌生化)比英语alienation更强调过程性——'变得陌生'而非'已经疏离'的状态", "source": "marx-philosophy-translation", "domain": "marx", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Entfremdung", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "异化", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'异化'字面义'变为异己'，接近德语原义的过程性；但中文缺少entfremden的日常用法(使疏远)，仅在哲学语境使用", "source": "marx-philosophy-translation", "domain": "marx", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "alienation", "source_lang": "en", "target_term": "aliénation", "target_lang": "fr", "differential": "法语aliénation保留了法律用语(让渡财产)和医学用语(精神错乱)的双重历史层；英语alienation的法律义已弱化", "source": "marx-philosophy-translation", "domain": "marx", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Dasein", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "being-there", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "英语being-there是字面直译(da=there, sein=being)，保留了空间隐喻但丢失了德语中Dasein作为日常词('存在/生活')的普通性", "source": "heidegger-philosophy-translation", "domain": "heidegger", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Dasein", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "此在", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'此在'是陈嘉映的译法，'此'对应da，'在'对应sein；但德语Dasein在日常中就是'存在'(如Dasein führen=过日子)，中文'此在'完全是哲学术语", "source": "heidegger-philosophy-translation", "domain": "heidegger", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Dasein", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "être-là", "target_lang": "fr", "differential": "法语être-là(在那里的存在)与being-there同构，法语传统中也常保留德语原词不译", "source": "heidegger-philosophy-translation", "domain": "heidegger", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Mehrwert", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "surplus value", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "德语Mehrwert(mehr=更多, Wert=价值)是透明的复合词；英语surplus value需要两个词表达，'surplus'的拉丁词源增加了形式距离", "source": "marx-philosophy-translation", "domain": "marx", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Mehrwert", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "剩余价值", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'剩余价值'字面义'剩下的价值'，与德语Mehrwert(更多的价值)有微妙差异——'剩余'暗示被动残留，'mehr'暗示主动超出", "source": "marx-philosophy-translation", "domain": "marx", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "surplus value", "source_lang": "en", "target_term": "plus-value", "target_lang": "fr", "differential": "法语plus-value(plus=更多)比英语surplus更接近德语Mehrwert的'超出'含义；法语中plus-value也用于房地产增值，保留了经济日常义", "source": "marx-philosophy-translation", "domain": "marx", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "jouissance", "source_lang": "fr", "target_term": "enjoyment", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "法语jouissance兼有性高潮义和法律上的'享用权'(jouissance d'un bien)义；英语enjoyment仅保留一般的'享受'义，Lacan理论中常保留法语原词不译", "source": "lacan-philosophy-translation", "domain": "lacan", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "jouissance", "source_lang": "fr", "target_term": "享乐", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'享乐'失去了jouissance的痛感维度——拉康的jouissance是超越快感原则的、包含痛苦的满足；中文有时译为'爽'但太口语化", "source": "lacan-philosophy-translation", "domain": "lacan", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Widerspruch", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "contradiction", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "德语Widerspruch(wider=反对, Spruch=言说)字面义'反驳/反说'，比英语contradiction(contra+dict=反说)更直接地嵌入言说(Spruch)传统", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Widerspruch", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "矛盾", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'矛盾'来自韩非子寓言(矛+盾的物理不兼容)，是具象隐喻；德语Widerspruch是语言行为(反说)。概念结构不同但指涉重叠", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Widerspruch", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "contradiction", "target_lang": "fr", "differential": "法语contradiction与英语同源(拉丁contra+dictio)，在黑格尔翻译中两者等价", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "différance", "source_lang": "fr", "target_term": "differance", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "英语保留法语拼写(仅去掉accent)作为不可翻译的标记；法语différance与différence的区别只在书写中可见(a/e)，听觉上不可分辨——这本身就是Derrida的论点", "source": "derrida-philosophy-translation", "domain": "derrida", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "différance", "source_lang": "fr", "target_term": "延异", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'延异'(延迟+差异)是对différer双义(espacement+temporisation)的显式编码；法语原词的隐式双义在中文中变为显式并置", "source": "derrida-philosophy-translation", "domain": "derrida", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Vernunft", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "reason", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "德语区分Verstand(知性/understanding)和Vernunft(理性/reason)；英语reason同时覆盖两者的日常义，哲学翻译中需要大写Reason标记", "source": "kant-hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Vernunft", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "理性", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'理性'在日常中常与'感性'对立，比德语Vernunft的使用范围更宽；黑格尔的Vernunft是超越Verstand(知性)的更高统一", "source": "kant-hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Vernunft", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "raison", "target_lang": "fr", "differential": "法语raison同英语reason一样覆盖范围过宽(avoir raison=有道理)，但法国哲学传统中raison的形而上学负载更重(笛卡尔-启蒙传统)", "source": "kant-hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Verstand", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "understanding", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "英语understanding的日常义(理解/谅解)远比德语Verstand(知性/分析性思维)宽泛；在康德翻译中understanding特指知性", "source": "kant-hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Verstand", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "知性", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'知性'是纯粹的哲学术语(无日常用法)，精确对应Verstand在康德体系中的位置(感性→知性→理性)", "source": "kant-hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Verstand", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "entendement", "target_lang": "fr", "differential": "法语entendement在近代哲学中(笛卡尔、洛克的法译)已固定为知性义，与日常entendre(听/理解)有清晰的语义分化", "source": "kant-hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Bestimmung", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "determination", "target_lang": "en", "differential": "德语Bestimmung兼有规定(determination)、使命(vocation/destiny)和调谐(Stimme=声音→使之发声)三义；英语determination丢失了使命义和声音词源", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
{"source_term": "Bestimmung", "source_lang": "de", "target_term": "规定", "target_lang": "zh", "differential": "中文'规定'保留了determination义但完全丢失了Bestimmung的使命义(Bestimmung des Menschen=人的使命)和声音词源(Stimme)", "source": "hegel-philosophy-translation", "domain": "hegel", "pos": "noun"}
